#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:12
#: 305034de20224aa2b4c697c60ca9265d 446ff4c1508648328ef71161aea069f4
msgid ""
"\"Brushed With Relay\" motor drivers accept a duty cycle to control the "
"speed and also have a separate pin used to control direction"
msgstr "「带继电器的有刷」电机驱动器接受占空比来控制速度，同时有一个独立引脚用于控制方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:13
#: 2402df22441f49e59e24cb17d652a5bf f9ea9b65a9c0442e891a20499969d0be
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"\"Brushed BiPolar\" motor drivers accept a duty cycle where 0% duty cycle "
"means full speed in one direction, 100% duty cycle is full speed in the "
"other direction and 50% duty cycle is stopped"
msgstr "「有刷双极」电机驱动器接受占空比，其中 0% 占空比表示一个方向全速，100% 占空比表示另一个方向全速，50% 占空比表示停止"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:33
#: 14e69ca1232f43bdb2a84cfcb4d67446 2c490f3f0fb94f228e30230d8659b686
msgid ""
"If using \"Brushed with Relay\" connect the :ref:`Relay <common-relay>` "
"pin(s) to the motor driver's direction pin(s)."
msgstr "如果使用「带继电器的有刷」，请将 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>` 引脚连接到电机驱动器的方向引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:34
#: 79a9a986ee08460c997610e2ce62ac10 87272a8b806240f19b8e3d5e45ab5e40
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` = 3 for \"BrushedWithRelay\" or \"4\""
" for \"BrushedBIPolar\" and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` 设置为 3（BrushedWithRelay）或 "
"4（BrushedBIPolar），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushed-motors.rst:35
#: 898ace54a0c74f24943bcd9ebdbcbe1e 8cececb654f04b39a6c489dbc6d3840c
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_PWM_FREQ <MOT_PWM_FREQ>` defaults to 16000 but can be changed to "
"any value from 1000 to 20000 to change the output frequency"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_PWM_FREQ <MOT_PWM_FREQ>` 默认为 16000，可更改为 1000 到 20000 之间的任意值以调整输出频率"
